	quest.11A312A059738B8A.quest_desc: [
		"The Andesite Template is the foundation of Create's progression in modpack It is the very first template you'll craft and serves as the starting point for every future technological tier."
		""
		"Like all other templates, it is used to unlock a new stage of progression. Once obtained, combine it with an Andesite Casing in a Smithing Table to create the upgrade component required for Andesite-tier machines."
		""
		"More importantly, the Andesite Template is the key to unlocking every template that follows. As you progress through the modpack, each new template will build upon the previous one, guiding you through Create's technology in a structured and rewarding way."
	]
	quest.12BB0693613A761E.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.144F9FA2D09AAE9B.quest_desc: ["The incubator block increases the growth rate of baby villagers."]
	quest.14B17932F51F7DFA.title: "Silken Strings"
	quest.157A16F8B43C8965.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.157A16F8B43C8965.title: "Work in Progress: Quest"
	quest.15FBA840FFFF6CD6.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.1648A692A807855E.quest_desc: ["If you click and hold a Brush in the air, after a few seconds you will have a chance to obtain a Dust Pile. By gathering and combining a few of these Dust Piles together, you can craft a solid Dust block."]
	quest.1648A692A807855E.quest_subtitle: "From Thin Air to Solid Blocks"
	quest.1648A692A807855E.title: "Brushing the Void"
	quest.16A009449D754CA4.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.16A009449D754CA4.title: "&5&lAntimatter Pellet&r&r"
	quest.16D73734E6EC4522.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.178863338F577583.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.178863338F577583.title: "Work in Progress: Quest"
	quest.17ADFE8FF7A9312A.quest_desc: [
		"The Copper Template represents the second stage of Create's progression in a modpack. After mastering the Andesite tier, it's time to advance into the Copper Age, where new machines, components, and crafting possibilities become available."
		""
		"Like every other template, the Copper Template follows the same progression system. Once crafted, it unlocks the Copper Tier, granting access to all Copper-based machines, components, and recipes."
		""
		"Each new template expands your technological capabilities, bringing you one step closer to the more advanced tiers that await later in your journey."
	]
	quest.186B27DF04705CA1.quest_desc: ["&7&lIndustrial Foregoing&r&r is a comprehensive, industrial automation mod designed to streamline and improve your in-game production systems! Inspired by the classic MineFactory Reloaded, it brings modern, tech-driven machinery and tools to Minecraft, allowing players to create intricate automated systems for farming, processing resources, animal care, and more"]
	quest.186B27DF04705CA1.title: "&7&lWelcome to Industrial Foregoing&r&r"
	quest.18FEBE453209B8DE.quest_desc: [
		"  &6&lFissile Fuel&r&r is the primary fuel used to power the &a&lFission Reactor&r&r."
		"  It is a highly radioactive substance created through advanced chemical and nuclear processing systems."
		"  When inserted into the reactor, &6&lFissile Fuel&r&r undergoes &bnuclear fission&r, generating large amounts of heat and &l&4energy&r&r."
		"  The efficiency and stability of the reactor depend heavily on maintaining a proper fuel supply and cooling system."
	]
	quest.18FEBE453209B8DE.title: "&6&lFissile Fuel&r&r"
	quest.195098325112C4ED.quest_subtitle: "+ Ignores Players"
	quest.1977601C615DB824.quest_desc: ["Intended for use on servers, this block allows you to expel other players from the chunk it's placed in. You can whitelist players with a Player Filter - OPs are always whitelisted."]
	quest.1AE7AD74AE5DB2F2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1B147BF0C0AAC11A.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1B21843CE37B89A1.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1B78D2B4D4542035.title: "Osmium"
	quest.1BB6D03ADBBFC616.quest_desc: ["With your inventory open, hover over the pebbles and press the 'K' key to compress them directly into their equivalent stone block. Also, sifting Gravel with a Flint Mesh is the only stage where a stone generator is not required. The pebbles obtained here are self-sustaining enough to even increase your total amount of Gravel!"]
	quest.1BB6D03ADBBFC616.quest_subtitle: "KKK K KKKKK"
	quest.1BB6D03ADBBFC616.title: "Pebbles"
	quest.1C330C5F59540D79.title: "Lava Generation"
	quest.1C8AEE2269A6B330.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1D5AB0038F40F358.quest_desc: ["The converter block converts villagers to zombie villagers and cures them afterwards, enabling the player that placed the block better trades from the cured villager. This block needs a golden apple, any type of potion of weakness and the villager to convert. This process takes approximately five minutes."]
	quest.1E0298655CA0D542.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.1E0408933E2C32A2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.1E60EADCD5581776.quest_desc: ["By sifting Dust, you can obtain Silicon Dioxide. This compound is incredibly useful, as many mineral materials, such as Gravel, Sand, and others, can be obtained through it. This will allow you to keep progressing in the modpack and securing more Gravel for your setups."]
	quest.1E60EADCD5581776.title: "Silicon Dioxide"
	quest.2122A55145FE9E58.quest_desc: [
		"The &b&lFTB Ultimine&r&r is the ultimate vein mining mod, designed to make resource gathering and terrain clearing faster without trivializing progression."
		""
		"By holding the assigned hotkey (default: ` or ~), you can mine multiple connected blocks of the same type at once. Whether you're following an ore vein, chopping down an entire tree, or clearing space for a new build, Ultimine significantly reduces repetitive mining while keeping gameplay engaging."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Balance Features"
		""
		"To preserve the intended progression and challenge of the modpack, FTB Ultimine includes a few important limitations:"
		""
		"&l16 Block Limit&r"
		"Each activation can mine up to 16 connected blocks. This prevents massive excavations with a single click while still providing a noticeable quality-of-life improvement."
		""
		"&lProper Tool Required&r"
		"Ultimine only works when you're using the correct tool for the targeted block. For example, use a pickaxe for stone and ores, or an axe for wood. Attempting to use the feature with your hand or an incorrect tool will have no effect, ensuring that Minecraft's durability and tool progression remain meaningful."
	]
	quest.2122A55145FE9E58.title: "&b&lFTB Ultimine&r&r"
	quest.2179092E872A06B2.quest_desc: [
		"  The &a&lFission Reactor&r&r is an advanced multiblock structure used to generate massive amounts of &l&4energy&r&r through nuclear fission."
		"  It consumes nuclear fuel and produces heat, which can then be converted into power to run machines and other systems."
		"  While operating, the reactor also generates &b&lNuclear Waste&r&r."
		"These byproducts should not be discarded, as they will become extremely important later in progression."
		"  Nuclear Waste can be processed into advanced materials such as&l &aPolonium&r&r and &l&9Plutonium&r&r, which are required for powerful late-game technologies, advanced energy production, and high-tier equipment."
	]
	quest.2179092E872A06B2.title: "&a&lFission Reactor&r&r"
	quest.21CCB6E3C10DC315.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.22F7061787812DD9.title: "Generating"
	quest.23D102ABF853ADAF.quest_subtitle: "-10 Max Spawn Delay"
	quest.2471A40DA14E7536.quest_desc: ["The trader block allows trading with the villager without having to deal with securing the villager. This block also allows the villager to restock in non-working hours. The restocking time of the villager is not dependent on any external sources like day/night time or dimension. You can customize the trading interval in the config."]
	quest.24C1981F58FAD524.title: "Item Vault"
	quest.24DE7BCC2E5A5A8C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.24E4F92BF3A07F12.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.252837E02D8560C2.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.26B2C2043B63AB78.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.279A3BA68B7B570D.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.28FAC8E651FC5893.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.290C34C04BB39BC9.quest_desc: [
		"  &5&lApplied Energistics 2&r&r is a powerful storage and automation mod centered around the &b&lME Network&r&r."
		"  It allows players to store massive amounts of items in a compact digital system while providing advanced tools for crafting and resource management."
		"  As your base expands, AE2 becomes an essential part of your infrastructure, helping you organize resources, automate complex crafting chains, and efficiently manage large-scale production."
		"  Its flexibility and depth make it one of the most powerful automation systems available for late-game progression."
	]
	quest.290C34C04BB39BC9.title: "Applied"
	quest.2A7DE7CCCE37A8DE.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.2C19682DBFC61044.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.2C19682DBFC61044.title: "Work in Progress: Quest"
	quest.2C3B265EE86A6755.quest_desc: ["a modpack designed to bring a complete modded Minecraft experience to low-end hardware without sacrificing progression, automation, or fun. Start with simple technologies and gradually work your way toward advanced machinery and automation, with custom recipes, balanced progression, and carefully integrated mods creating a smooth and rewarding journey. Whether you're new to modded Minecraft or an experienced player, there's always something new to discover.Build, automate, progress, and create your own factory!"]
	quest.2C3B265EE86A6755.title: "&z&lWelcome to Skyindustries Alchemic&r&r"
	quest.2C654F5B6C2B7482.quest_desc: [
		"The idea behind Skyindustries Alchemic came from the frustration of playing modpacks that often follow the same predictable progression, either making the game too easy or overwhelming the player with countless mechanics and overpowered shortcuts. The goal was to create something different: a lightweight, challenging, and well-structured experience where progression actually matters and every technological milestone feels earned."
		""
		"The pack was designed to bring together automation, technology, and progression while remaining accessible to players with weaker hardware. Every change, recipe, and progression stage was made with one goal in mind: to make your journey through the factory feel rewarding from beginning to end. "
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&6&lWant something easy? Go play ATM.&r&r"
	]
	quest.2C654F5B6C2B7482.title: "&z&lThe Origin of the Idea&r&r"
	quest.2C92FA70EEBF0B25.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.2D7C4D706F89335E.title: "Advanced Machines"
	quest.2DD926ECAE128C39.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.2E2DD7C9016D288E.quest_desc: [
		"The &b&lFTB Chunks&r&r mod is your primary tool for territory management and world navigation. It allows you to view the surrounding world, claim land, and keep your machines and builds protected with ease."
		""
		"Open the map by clicking the map icon in the top-left corner of your screen. From there, you can claim and manage chunks, view biome information in real time, and create waypoints to quickly mark important locations such as your base, mines, or other points of interest."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Balance Features"
		""
		"To ensure fair gameplay and maintain server performance, territory management follows a few important limits:"
		""
		"&l64 Claimed Chunks&r"
		"You can claim up to 64 chunks. Claimed chunks protect your builds, machines, and storage by preventing unauthorized players from breaking blocks or interacting with your systems."
		""
		"&l9 Force-Loaded Chunks&r"
		"Up to 9 claimed chunks can be force-loaded at any time. Simply hold Shift and click on one of your claimed chunks to keep it permanently loaded. This allows your machines, energy networks, AE2 systems, Mekanism factories, and other automations to continue running even while you're far away, in another dimension, or offline. The limit helps reduce unnecessary server load while keeping automation efficient and maintaining a zero-lag experience."
	]
	quest.2E2DD7C9016D288E.title: "&b&lFTB Chunks&r&r"
	quest.2E92426520B8C72A.quest_desc: [
		"  The &5&lSPS Reactor&r&r is an advanced late-game machine used &l&bto transform antimatter-related materials through extremely high energy input&r&r."
		"  It is one of the most power-hungry structures in the &a&lWorld&r&r and requires a massive &4&lenergy&r&r supply to operate efficiently."
		"  The &5&lSPS&r&r works by using large amounts of &l&4energy&r&r to process specific resources into more advanced materials needed for &9&lendgame technology and progression&r&r."
		"  Because of its complexity and power demands, it is usually powered by systems such as the &l&5Fusion Reactor&r&r."
		"  Once active, the &5&lSPS&r&r becomes a key part of advanced production chains, unlocking some of the strongest technology and equipment available."
	]
	quest.2E92426520B8C72A.title: "&5&lSupercritical Phase Shifter&r&r"
	quest.2E9E8FD6FEAF781D.quest_subtitle: "+2 Activation Range"
	quest.2F0425F46233C650.title: "Starting"
	quest.3013F2D67037C816.quest_desc: ["Harvests crops in a configurable radius (from 3x3 to 9x9) around the pylon and outputs to an inventory above. Place the pylon inside the water block of the farm."]
	quest.31CCC4EDE7163D74.title: "Hoe"
	quest.31F2CAA16E3CF117.quest_desc: [
		"  &7&lMekanism&r&r is a technology mod that adds advanced machines, automation, and powerful energy systems to Minecraft."
		"  Starting with basic resource processing, players can progress through complex factories, chemical production, and nuclear technology."
		"  From simple machines to fusion reactors and &5&lantimatter&r&r production, Mekanism offers a complete technological journey focused on efficiency, innovation, and large-scale automation."
	]
	quest.31F2CAA16E3CF117.title: "&7&lWelcome to Mekanism!&r&r"
	quest.32A99EEC8B3196F3.quest_desc: ["The Crook increases the chances of dropping saplings from trees and is essential for finding Silkworms. The Hammer is used to smash blocks: break Cobblestone to get Gravel, Gravel to get Sand, and Sand to get Dust."]
	quest.32A99EEC8B3196F3.title: "Basic Tools"
	quest.3356D6172613FBF9.title: "Ultimate Machines"
	quest.33990E2143E9BD10.quest_desc: ["&6&lSkyindustries Alchemic&r&r  is the work of Sucolaranja, a TikTok content creator dedicated to making modded Minecraft easier to understand. Through guides, tips, and gameplay, he helps players discover the world of mods and become part of the growing modding community."]
	quest.33990E2143E9BD10.title: "&z&lCreator&r&r"
	quest.33FC767CCC421B4B.quest_desc: [""]
