	quest.6DFE16CF06755BD6.title: "Quantum Armor"
	quest.6F640D84EEFAA37E.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6FE762D1F73BEC32.quest_desc: [
		"&b&lFTB Essentials&r&r is a lightweight utility mod that provides the essential multiplayer commands expected from modern Minecraft servers. As the spiritual successor to classic plugins like EssentialsX, it offers seamless integration while keeping the experience simple and reliable."
		""
		"To preserve progression and encourage exploration, several commands have custom cooldowns. Use them wisely, as each teleport should be a strategic decision rather than a quick escape."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Command Cooldowns"
		""
		"The following commands are available with the listed cooldowns:"
		""
		"&l/rtp&r — 7-day cooldown"
		"&l/back&r — 25-minute cooldown"
		"&l/home&r — 25-minute cooldown"
		"&l/playerspawn&r — 25-minute cooldown"
		"&l/spawn&r — 25-minute cooldown"
		"&l/tpa&r — 5-minute cooldown"
		""
		"These cooldowns help maintain a balanced multiplayer experience by reducing teleport spam while still providing convenient travel options when they matter most."
	]
	quest.6FE762D1F73BEC32.title: "&b&lFTB Essentials&r&r"
	quest.6FFDFC27C2E1DAFD.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7048065DE791F572.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7048065DE791F572.title: "Cables"
	quest.71CC981C8658A29A.quest_desc: [
		"Before crafting the Brass Template, you must first obtain the Copper Template, as each template must be unlocked in order."
		""
		"Like every other template in the modpack, the Brass Template follows the same progression system. Once crafted, it grants access to the Brass Tier, unlocking all Brass-based components, machines, and recipes."
		""
		"Each template represents a new stage of technological progression, so make sure you've completed the previous tier before moving on to the next."
	]
	quest.72F017AAADC73880.quest_subtitle: "+2 Max Entities"
	quest.7321F9E08CC7D2DE.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.742CE079CD0F5EED.quest_desc: ["Did you know that applying Bone Meal to Mycelium has a chance to spawn mushrooms? By taking advantage of this mechanic, you can easily set up a system to produce mushrooms automatically!"]
	quest.762991DCC3DF530C.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.76D415F3F1FD5FDA.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
	quest.786D75A23B820CAA.quest_subtitle: "+ Silent"
	quest.786D75A23B820CAA.title: "Wool"
	quest.78FC09E0B0D06244.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.79DC93C3E39A50D4.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7B105BD2AD1E4B1C.quest_desc: [
		"Create is one of the core mods in SL Factory Otimized and will be an essential part of your progression. Throughout your journey, you'll notice a number of balance changes designed to better fit the modpack's progression and overall gameplay experience."
		""
		"Don't worry—these changes aren't meant to make the mod unnecessarily complicated. Instead, they encourage you to explore Create's mechanics while keeping every machine, resource, and milestone meaningful as you advance through the modpack."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"Progression Changes"
		""
		"While Create retains its familiar gameplay, its progression has been rebalanced to better fit the experience of SL Factory Otimized."
		""
		"The biggest change is the introduction of Progression Templates. Each stage of Create now requires a specific template to unlock the next tier of machines and components. This prevents players from rushing through the mod and ensures that every milestone feels earned."
		""
		"As you complete quests and advance through the modpack, you'll gain access to new templates, allowing you to craft more advanced Create components and continue your technological journey."
		""
		"The mechanics of Create remain unchanged—the Templates simply guide your progression, making every advancement more meaningful and rewarding."
	]
	quest.7B105BD2AD1E4B1C.title: "Welcome"
	quest.7B1493C75A729FA7.quest_desc: [
		"It was just to make it &lsymmetrical&r "
		"&b(it brothers me)&r."
	]
	quest.7B1493C75A729FA7.quest_subtitle: "Yes I know"
	quest.7C64EDBEA77695EB.title: "Seeds"
	quest.7C65BB78D5441DA3.title: "Golden Mesh"
	quest.7D096089750267E5.title: "To The End"
	quest.7DC62A4E9345C979.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7E3A9E93F37A9D18.quest_desc: [
		"  The &4&lFusion Reactor&r&r is an extremely advanced power source designed for late-game energy production."
		"   Using nuclear fusion, it generates an enormous amount of power capable of running entire factory systems and high-tier machines with ease."
		"  Unlike the Fusion Reactor, which works by splitting atoms, the Fusion Reactor creates energy by fusing them together under extreme temperatures."
		"  Once the reaction becomes stable, the reactor can continuously produce massive amounts of energy with incredible efficiency."
		"  Building and maintaining a Fusion Reactor requires &badvanced infrastructure&r, a steady fuel supply, and proper system management to keep the reaction stable and running smoothly."
	]
	quest.7E3A9E93F37A9D18.title: "&4&lFusion Reactor&r&r"
	quest.7E5C199B8DAF4E5F.quest_desc: ["This quest is currently under production and is not yet available. It will be added soon in future updates!"]
